Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.47,0:00:17.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝正在试图打破这66个封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith is trying to break the 66 seals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.04,0:00:19.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把路西法从地狱里释放出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}To free lucifer from hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.27,0:00:21.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路西法将带来天启\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer will bring the apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.33,0:00:43.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你占据了某个混蛋的身体?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're possessing some poor bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.93,0:00:46.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只是一具皮囊而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is...a vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.67,0:00:49.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我同意占据他的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to give my consent to invite him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.95,0:01:00.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恰克 雪莉?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chuck shurley?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.08,0:01:02.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的生活已经被你写进你的书里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a life. you've been using it to write your books.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.48,0:01:04.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  让他走  这个人是被庇护的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean,let him go. this man is to be protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.82,0:01:06.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么? 他是主的先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? he's a prophet of the lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.75,0:01:09.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你是谁？- 我是撒迦利亚  卡西迪奥的上司\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - I'm zachariah. I'm castiel's superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.42,0:01:11.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我要怎么去干掉莉莉丝？- 没你什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And how am I gonna ice lilith? - You're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.09,0:01:12.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝正要去打破最后一个封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith's going to break the final seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.49,0:01:13.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不想去阻止天启，是么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to stop it,do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.79,0:01:16.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是上帝选中的  你要去阻止它\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are chosen. you will stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.20,0:01:19.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是不是莉莉丝或者天启  就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just...not lilith or the apocalypse,that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.14,0:01:31.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.29,0:01:40.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  我们走  - 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy,let's go. - Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.12,0:01:44.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.66,0:01:48.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.50,0:01:49.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.40,0:02:26.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么鬼名字?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the devil is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.00,0:02:31.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约塞米蒂 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo...yosemite sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.64,0:02:33.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约塞米蒂 萨姆?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yosemite sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.21,0:02:35.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm,let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.08,0:02:36.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.08,0:02:38.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah,here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.38,0:02:42.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.32,0:02:44.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.25,0:02:48.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位旅客  这是飞行简短播报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Folks,quick word from the flight deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.09,0:02:50.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚飞过伊尔切斯特  然后是埃利科特城\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just passing over ilchester,then ellicott city,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.02,0:02:52.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们将先降落在巴尔的摩\N{\fnArial\fs30}On our initial descent into baltimore...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.03,0:02:54.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊尔切斯特？我们刚才不是在那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ilchester? weren't we just there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.96,0:02:56.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你愿意去散步\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you'd like to stretch your legs,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.63,0:02:57.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在会是好时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now would be a good time to --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.93,0:02:59.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我靠!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.50,0:03:31.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,州长欧玛丽呼吁民众保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and governor o'malley urged calm,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.33,0:03:33.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,表示恐怖份子把一座废弃的修道院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saying it's very unlikely an abandoned convent
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.20,0:03:35.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作为目标另人难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would be a target for terrorists,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.20,0:03:37.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 无论国外还是国内  - 换台\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Either foreign or homegrown. - Change the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.41,0:03:38.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飓风金利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Announcer #2: hurricane kinley,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.87,0:03:40.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然猛烈登陆加尔维斯顿地区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unexpectedly slamming into the galveston area...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.81,0:03:44.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宣布了北朝鲜核试验成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Announcer #3: ...announced a successful test of the north korean nuclear...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.08,0:03:45.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 困惑  - 猪流感\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Announcer #4: ...baffled... - Announcer #5: ...swine flu...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.59,0:03:54.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean --
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.69,0:03:56.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别  什么都别说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't...don't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.03,0:04:00.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.70,0:04:03.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只要保持冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just got to keep our heads down
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.60,0:04:05.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先敲定这个  好么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And hash this out,all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.37,0:04:09.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.90,0:04:11.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  重要的事情先来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,well,first things first --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.24,0:04:13.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是如何最后上了"灵魂飞机"?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did we end up on "soul plane"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.14,0:04:15.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是天使们?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels,maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.14,0:04:17.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是 带我们走出险境\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,you know,beaming us out of harm's way?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.71,0:04:20.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论如何  这是我们最担心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,whatever. it's the least of our worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.55,0:04:21.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要找到卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.36,0:05:08.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.83,0:05:10.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊 恰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah! hey,chuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.66,0:05:12.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So... you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.50,0:05:14.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头被你砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,my head hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.67,0:05:16.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我的意思是 我最后的幻像\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,I mean -- I mean,my -- my last vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.00,0:05:18.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看上像装了新款的马达\N{\fnArial\fs30}You went,like,full-on vader.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.97,0:05:21.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你体温150度  你的心率200\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your body temperature was 150. your heart rate was 200.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.61,0:05:22.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的眼睛是黑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your eyes were black.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.98,0:05:24.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的眼睛变黑了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your eyes went black?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.48,0:05:27.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.92,0:05:31.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.82,0:05:33.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.85,0:05:35.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或被驱逐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.76,0:05:38.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大天使放弃了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The archangel smote the crap out of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.63,0:05:39.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉  你肯定么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. you're sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.06,0:05:42.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是也许他只是在光芒或是什么东西中消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,maybe he just vanished into the light or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.20,0:05:44.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  他像是被打爆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,no. he,like,exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.93,0:05:47.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像个肥皂泡球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a water balloon of chunky soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.57,0:05:52.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.74,0:05:54.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh...right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.04,0:05:56.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.25,0:06:00.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,god.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.85,0:06:05.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是一颗臼齿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a molar?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.59,0:06:08.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我头发里怎么会有一颗臼齿?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I have a molar in my hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.49,0:06:12.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是非常操蛋的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has been a really stressful day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.06,0:06:15.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西  你这个蠢蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass,you stupid bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.46,0:06:17.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蠢?他以前试着帮助我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid? he was trying to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.33,0:06:18.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.90,0:06:20.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在怎样？我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,what now? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.73,0:06:23.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.84,0:06:25.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.01,0:06:27.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能感觉他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.57,0:06:29.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉我们会找到你这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought we'd find you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.68,0:06:33.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,游戏时间结束  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Playtime's over,dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.38,0:06:36.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是时候和我们一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:38.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只要保持距离  傻帽\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just keep your distance,ass-hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.72,0:06:40.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很烦恼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.92,0:06:43.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah -- a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.09,0:06:45.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要脸的发动审判日\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sons of bitches jump-started judgment day!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.36,0:06:47.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们该让它发生  我们不启动任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we let it happen. we didn't start anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.03,0:06:49.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吗  萨姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right,sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.43,0:06:52.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有一个机会阻止你兄弟  但你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a chance to stop your brother,and you couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.67,0:06:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因此  我们不要纠缠谁开始什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's not quibble over who started what.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.07,0:06:58.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只说我们的缺点  然后前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just say it was all our faults and move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.74,0:07:00.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管你喜欢不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause like it or not...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.04,0:07:04.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在是天启了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...it's apocalypse now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.68,0:07:06.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要再次回归同一队来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're back on the same team again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.68,0:07:08.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.22,0:07:10.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想杀死恶魔  我们需要你杀死恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to kill the devil. we want you to kill the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.08,0:07:11.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's...synergy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.72,0:07:14.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这次该相信你么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm just supposed to trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.55,0:07:16.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你脑子里全是一团糨糊 丑八怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cram it with walnuts,ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.42,0:07:18.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是一场游戏  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a game,son.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.99,0:07:22.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路西法的力量不是语言可以形容的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer is powerful in ways that defy description.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.46,0:07:25.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在必须小心突击\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to strike now,hard and fast --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.76,0:07:27.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在他发现他的皮囊之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before he finds his vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.43,0:07:28.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的皮囊?\N{\fnArial\fs30}His vessel?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.03,0:07:31.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路西法也需要肉身吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer needs a meat suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.57,0:07:33.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.24,0:07:36.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自然要按规矩办事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Them's the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.81,0:07:38.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦他降临人间\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when he touches down,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.18,0:07:41.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天启四骑士 赤红的江河  炽热的天来临的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're talking four horsemen,red oceans,fiery skies --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.45,0:07:43.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也离我们不远了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The greatest hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:45.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以阻止他  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can stop him,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.22,0:07:47.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你需要我们的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you need our help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.62,0:07:51.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我听着  你这个两面派的蠢驴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You listen to me,you two-faced douche --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.52,0:07:55.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看了你做的那些事之后  我就不会再指望你什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After what you did,I don't want jack squat from you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.19,0:07:56.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我听着  小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You listen to me,boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.03,0:08:00.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要和我们作对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can rebel against us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.10,0:08:01.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,象路西法那样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}As Lucifer did?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.40,0:08:04.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.40,0:08:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.17,0:08:09.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以防万一你们这群家伙出现  我给自己买了个小保险\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little insurance policy in case you dicks showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.55,0:08:14.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.22,0:08:25.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是跟我朋友卡西学来的  你们这群狗娘养的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Learned that from my friend Cass,you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.93,0:08:29.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简直糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This sucks ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.46,0:08:59.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.86,0:09:04.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,魔法袋  有了这个  那些天使就找不到我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hex bags. No way the angels will find us with those.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.40,0:09:05.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,魔鬼也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons,either,for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.73,0:09:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-在哪儿弄到的  - 我自己弄的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where'd you get it? - I made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.16,0:09:07.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么弄\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:14.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,露比教我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I... I learned it from Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.18,0:09:19.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说起这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.84,0:09:21.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你身体没什么状况吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.65,0:09:24.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有嗜血的欲望没  或是别的什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you jonesing for another hit of bitch blood or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.25,0:09:26.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-it's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.38,0:09:28.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但事实就是  我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh,tell you the truth,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.62,0:09:30.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不发抖  没发烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No shakes,no fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.22,0:09:31.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是那个把我放进飞机里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like whoever...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.81,0:09:33.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便也给我治好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put me on that plane cleaned me right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.46,0:09:36.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超自然牌镇定剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supernatural methadone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.26,0:09:37.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  我想也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.70,0:09:41.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-迪恩  - 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean. - Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.87,0:09:45.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事了  你什么都不用说\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. You don't have to say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.51,0:09:49.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.71,0:09:52.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然我能说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because what can I even say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.28,0:09:54.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我全搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'm sorry"? "I screwed up"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.55,0:09:58.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那不是真的为了正义而战  你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't really do it justice,you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.75,0:10:01.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我无话可说也无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,there's nothing I can do or say
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.82,0:10:03.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经不能改变事实了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That will ever make this right --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.45,0:10:05.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你何必要继续说下去呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why do you keep bringing it up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.46,0:10:12.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我的意思是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,all I'm saying is,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.23,0:10:14.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们为何不把事情看简单一点呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do we have to put this under a microscope?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.30,0:10:17.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们搞砸了  我们就收拾残局  就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made a mess. We clean it up. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.97,0:10:21.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只是另外一个驱魔行动而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,so,say this is just any other hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.94,0:10:23.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  我们现在该做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know? What do we do first?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.61,0:10:27.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们应该去找到那些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd,uh,figure out where the thing is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.55,0:10:28.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.78,0:10:30.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就去找那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we just got to find...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.02,0:10:32.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.00,0:10:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(特拉华州  派克河)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.60,0:11:56.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right,keep it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.70,0:11:59.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要怕  不要怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it together,man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.19,0:12:19.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是你 尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you,Nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.12,0:12:21.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're special.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.49,0:12:23.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是被选中的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're chosen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.35,0:12:49.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着  萨姆抚摸\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And then Sam touched" --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.15,0:12:50.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.38,0:12:52.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱抚着迪恩的锁骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Caressed Dean's clavicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.75,0:12:56.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行  迪恩说\N{\fnArial\fs30}"'This is wrong,' said Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.12,0:12:59.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不管对错与否\N{\fnArial\fs30}"'Then I don't want to be right,'
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.53,0:13:02.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆用沙哑的声音回道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Replied Sam,in a husky voice."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.67,0:13:13.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh...my...god.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.57,0:13:15.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.04,0:13:17.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你是  - 卡佛·爱德伦  你好贝基\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're... - Carver Edlund,yeah. Hi,Becky.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.84,0:13:18.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你收到我的信了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got my letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.01,0:13:20.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有我的杏仁蛋白软糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my marzipan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.58,0:13:22.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  是的  味道很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,yeah. um...yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.88,0:13:23.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But,uh --
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.92,0:13:26.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是你的头号粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am your number-one fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.69,0:13:30.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  我是舔舐萨姆81\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,I'm Samlicker81.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.12,0:13:31.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思  你是  你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. You're -- you're what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.69,0:13:33.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"不只是兄弟情"网站的女站长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Webmistress at morethanbrothers.net?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.39,0:13:36.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  对  你是我的头号粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,yeah. no,yeah. you're my...number-one fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.33,0:13:38.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我才要找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I contacted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.90,0:13:40.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是唯一信我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the only one who will believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.87,0:13:43.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.30,0:13:44.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.30,0:13:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被监视了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm being watched.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.17,0:13:49.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过至少现在应该没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,not now -- at least,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.31,0:13:51.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我时间不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.28,0:13:52.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.68,0:13:55.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要我的帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need my help?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.41,0:13:56.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:14:00.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你帮我捎信给萨姆和迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to get a message to Sam and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.85,0:14:02.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.16,0:14:07.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  爱德伦先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look,mr. Edlund...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.59,0:14:09.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不错  我是你的粉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes,I'm a fan,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.16,0:14:10.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我真不愿意被人嘲弄\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I really don't appreciate being mocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.80,0:14:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只知道"凶鬼恶灵"是一本书而已  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that "supernatural's" just a book,okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.47,0:14:15.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能区分现实和想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the difference between fantasy and reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.43,0:14:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝基 那些都是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky,it's all real.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.57,0:14:18.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.01,0:14:21.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过你能解释一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then how would you explain an earthquake,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.21,0:14:22.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何地震  飓风和与日俱增的龙卷风\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hurricane,and multiple tornadoes,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.88,0:14:24.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会同时刻出现在地球吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All at the same time,all around the globe?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.88,0:14:26.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三个字  碳排放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two words -- carbon emissions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.78,0:14:28.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  波动凹凸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,right,wavy gravy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.60,0:14:45.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女士  你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay,lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.16,0:14:48.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  真的是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam...is it really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:51.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你长得真壮实\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're so firm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.04,0:14:54.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认识你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I know you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.67,0:14:57.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不认识  但我认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. But I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.18,0:14:58.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是萨姆·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Sam Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.78,0:14:59.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.98,0:15:03.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我描写的不太一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}...not what I pictured.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.42,0:15:06.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫贝基\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Becky.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.69,0:15:08.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我读了关于你们所有的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I read all about you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.96,0:15:10.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还写了一些...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've even written a few --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.22,0:15:13.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.86,0:15:15.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爱德伦先生告诉我你们在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Edlund told me where you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:16.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恰克?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.16,0:15:21.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有事要转告  但他被监视了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got a message,but he's being watched.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.60,0:15:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.87,0:15:24.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便说下  这个开场真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice change-up to the mythology,by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.97,0:15:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些魔鬼正在衰弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon stuff was getting kind of old.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.47,0:15:28.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  他要转告什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. just,um... what's the message?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.84,0:15:30.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他又看到幻象了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.41,0:15:33.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使落下米迦勒之剑于地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}"the michael sword is on earth. the angels lost it."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.51,0:15:34.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米迦勒之剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The michael sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.58,0:15:35.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝基  他知道剑在哪儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky,does he know where it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.92,0:15:39.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在山岗上有42只看门狗把守的城堡里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a castle,on a hill made of 42 dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.09,0:15:41.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,42只看门狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}42 dogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.22,0:15:42.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定没记错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are...you sure you got that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.92,0:15:46.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来是挺荒谬  不过正是他所说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't make sense,but that's what he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.39,0:15:49.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记住了他说的每一个字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I memorized every word...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.13,0:15:51.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}For you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.80,0:15:57.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝基  能否请你不要再摸我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Becky,c-- uh,can you...quit touching me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.20,0:15:58.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.96,0:16:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.13,0:16:30.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴你们还安然无恙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you boys all in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.84,0:16:33.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没被跟踪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't followed,were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.14,0:16:34.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被谁跟踪  天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean by angels,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.44,0:16:36.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,魔鬼还是超级萨迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons,or Sam's new superfan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.98,0:16:38.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.24,0:16:40.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  罗密欧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard,Romeo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.68,0:16:43.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么是米迦勒之剑  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So... Sword of Michael,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.72,0:16:45.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为我们所说的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think we're talking about the actual sword
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.52,0:16:46.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在真实的天使长手中的真剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the actual archangel?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.05,0:16:48.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但愿如此吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better friggin' hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.16,0:16:54.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是米迦勒  最强的天使混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Michael ... toughest sumbitch they got.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.00,0:16:58.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开玩笑吧  强\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kidding me? tough?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.50,0:17:00.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他看上去像凯特·布兰切特\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy looks like Cate Blanchett.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.30,0:17:03.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会想在昏暗的小道中遇上他  相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,I wouldn't want to meet him in a dark alley,believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.07,0:17:05.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他指挥着天使们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He commands the heavenly host.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.30,0:17:07.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在最后的天使大战中\N{\fnArial\fs30}During the last big dust-up upstairs,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.47,0:17:10.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他把路西法赶进了地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the one who booted Lucifer's ass to the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.41,0:17:11.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用的就是这把剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did it with that sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.88,0:17:13.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那如果我们能找到它的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if we can find it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.21,0:17:14.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能再让他滚蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can kick the devil's ass all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.15,0:17:17.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那我们从哪入手\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. So,where do we start?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.05,0:17:19.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先分头看书吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Divvy up and start reading...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.79,0:17:22.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试着弄清楚恰克的胡言乱语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try and make sense of chuck's nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.27,0:17:36.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.64,0:17:37.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.11,0:17:42.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.98,0:17:45.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  这都是我的错  我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby,this is all my fault. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.71,0:17:46.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.85,0:17:48.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莉丝没打破最后的封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith did not break the final seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.28,0:17:51.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她就是最后的封印\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lilith was the final seal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.98,0:17:53.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam,stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.19,0:17:56.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我杀了她  是我把路西法放出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed her,and I set lucifer free.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.39,0:17:57.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.56,0:18:00.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们叫我要小心提防露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys warned me about Ruby,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.23,0:18:03.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别碰恶魔之学  但我不听\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon blood,but I didn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.20,0:18:04.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我把他放出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought this on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.61,0:18:18.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真谢谢了你的不听话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're damn right you didn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.64,0:18:21.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你冲动  自私  傲慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were reckless and selfish and arrogant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.85,0:18:23.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.12,0:18:24.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.35,0:18:28.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,内疚是你导致了这场世界存亡之战\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sorry you started armageddon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.29,0:18:33.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这件事情不能被原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}This kind of thing don't get forgiven,boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.73,0:18:40.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们最后能奇迹般的渡过难关\N{\fnArial\fs30}If,by some miracle,we pull this off...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.17,0:18:43.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想再见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to lose my number.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.94,0:18:45.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.38,0:18:57.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,附近有个旧教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's an old church nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.45,0:19:01.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我该去那里查查相关记载\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'll go read some of the lore books there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.69,0:19:03.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.16,0:19:04.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.75,0:19:34.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没想到你父亲是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never would have guessed that your daddy was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.52,0:19:35.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.86,0:19:38.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于你的弟弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}About your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.29,0:19:40.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}What John said
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.23,0:19:42.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要么救萨姆  要么杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You save sam or kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.66,0:19:45.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.83,0:19:47.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.27,0:19:49.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们不该那么拼命的救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we shouldn't have tried so hard to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.94,0:19:51.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.17,0:19:53.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他招来了世界末日  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ended the world,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.37,0:19:56.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和我都没能成功的阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you and I weren't strong enough to stop him proper.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.18,0:19:57.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.01,0:20:00.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.48,0:20:04.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.59,0:20:09.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's got to be in here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.59,0:20:10.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.06,0:20:13.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.89,0:20:15.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.63,0:20:16.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.96,0:20:18.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这到底是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.30,0:20:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是爸爸在纽约北部锁柜的卡片\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a card for my Dad's lockup in upstate New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.07,0:20:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,念念\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.27,0:20:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城堡储物  流浪山42号\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Castle storage. 42 rover hill."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.37,0:20:27.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是山上的一座城堡  那山上有42条狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castle on a hill of 42 dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.98,0:20:32.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认为你爸爸一直都保管着米迦勒之剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you think your Dad had the Michael Sword all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.18,0:20:33.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  我想先知就是这个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I'm not sure what else Chuck could have meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.35,0:20:36.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.58,0:20:37.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.85,0:20:39.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我来说  这真是个好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.89,0:21:13.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就知道你是个会无声无息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always knew you were a big,dumb,slow,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.00,0:21:15.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢慢扩散的伤口  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dim pain in the ass,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.93,0:21:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但没想到你还是位贵客\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I never dreamt you were so v.i.p.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.50,0:21:25.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想阻止路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,you're gonna ice the devil?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.24,0:21:26.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就凭你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.48,0:21:28.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要知道的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I'd have known that,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.84,0:21:32.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早把你漂亮的脸蛋剥下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have ripped your pretty,pretty face off ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.35,0:21:33.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ruby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.55,0:21:36.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再猜猜  想想更早的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try again. Go back further.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.45,0:21:38.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.52,0:21:40.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.89,0:21:45.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  这是奇迹发生的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are the days of miracle and wonder,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.53,0:21:47.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲大人出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our father's among us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.13,0:21:49.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道  从我们还是人类的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know we're all dreaming again
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.43,0:21:52.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这么盼望着\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the first time since we were human?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.07,0:21:53.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是人间天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's heaven on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.87,0:21:54.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或人间地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.64,0:21:58.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们欠你弟弟一个果篮\N{\fnArial\fs30}We really owe your brother a fruit basket.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.04,0:22:01.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老天  你太罗嗦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My god,you like the sound of your own voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.21,0:22:02.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you,on the other hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.44,0:22:04.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就像是马路上的障碍物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the only bump in the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.75,0:22:07.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每个恶魔  每一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So every demon... every single one...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.15,0:22:09.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都想咬你一口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is just dying for a piece of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.35,0:22:11.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先排队吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.45,0:22:13.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可排在前头哦  宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,I'm in the front of the line,baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.76,0:22:14.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.07,0:22:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么  花生黄油\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that -- peanut butter?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.37,0:22:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  你的代理老爸还醒着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,your surrogate daddy's still awake...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.87,0:22:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在身体里尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screaming in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.77,0:22:30.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想让他感受下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want him to know how it feels
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.84,0:22:32.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你切成一片片的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slicing the life out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.88,0:22:35.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.85,0:22:39.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.78,0:22:41.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.88,0:22:43.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.81,0:23:04.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.74,0:23:08.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heya,sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.11,0:23:10.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想我吗  我是很想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You miss me? 'Cause I sure missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.08,0:23:11.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.19,0:23:24.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有了恶魔的超能力  不好受吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not so easy without those super-special demon powers,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.06,0:23:27.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh,Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.66,0:25:39.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.19,0:25:40.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}N-no!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.76,0:25:44.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.40,0:25:46.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.13,0:25:47.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.84,0:25:51.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  天啊  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,god,no!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.57,0:25:53.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need some help here!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.88,0:25:55.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  他被刺伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened? he was stabbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.71,0:25:57.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,推张床来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we get a gurney?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.58,0:26:03.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.82,0:26:05.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我们不能离开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,no,we ... we can't just leave him!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.69,0:26:07.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别走  我有问题要问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't move. I've got questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.56,0:26:11.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  我们得走了  - 不  不行  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sammy,we got to go. - No. No way,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.33,0:26:12.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔们知道剑在哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demons heard where the sword is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.76,0:26:13.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得赶在他们之前拿到剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get to it before they do,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.03,0:26:15.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果还来得及的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're not too late already.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.66,0:26:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.94,0:27:06.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你们已经把剑的位置告诉恶魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you told the demons where the sword is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.55,0:27:08.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感谢上帝  天使们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,thank God. The angels are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.38,0:27:09.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想想看\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to think...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.82,0:27:11.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们原本随时都可以拿到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They could have grabbed it any time they wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.72,0:27:17.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剑就在他们眼皮底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was right in front of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.89,0:27:19.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.93,0:27:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恰克的这个预言或许是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may have planted that particular piece of prophecy
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.26,0:27:25.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有意放进他脑子里的  可它碰巧是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside Chuck's skull,but it happened to be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.70,0:27:27.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们确实丢失了米迦勒之剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did lose the Michael Sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.27,0:27:29.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的找不到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We truly couldn't find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.70,0:27:31.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到现在  你亲手把它交还给了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until now. You've just hand-delivered it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.91,0:27:33.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.14,0:27:39.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋  你就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's you,Chucklehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.75,0:27:44.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是米迦勒之剑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the Michael Sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.99,0:28:00.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  你真以为自己能杀死路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What... You thought you could actually kill Lucifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.20,0:28:05.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就凭你个自怨自艾强颜傻笑的惊弓之鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You simpering wad of insecurity and self-loathing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.20,0:28:07.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.07,0:28:08.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只是个人类  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just a human,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.37,0:28:11.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不完全是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And not much of one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.71,0:28:13.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说我是那把剑是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean,I'm the sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.48,0:28:14.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是米迦勒的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Michael's weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.78,0:28:17.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者说  他的  容器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or,rather,his...receptacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.48,0:28:20.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是个皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a vessel?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.82,0:28:21.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.95,0:28:24.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米迦勒的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael's vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.79,0:28:26.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能  为什么  为什么是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}How? Why ... why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.89,0:28:29.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你命中注定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're chosen!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.43,0:28:30.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是荣誉  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a great honor,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.76,0:28:31.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.89,0:28:34.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给天使做活套子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,life as an angel condom.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.43,0:28:36.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's real fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.80,0:28:38.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是不用了  多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'll pass,thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.37,0:28:42.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玩笑  又是玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joking. Always joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.64,0:28:45.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不开玩笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well... no more jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.15,0:28:50.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.28,0:28:51.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.68,0:28:54.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你再骂  断的就不止是他的腿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep mouthing off,I'll break more than his legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.88,0:29:00.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我受够了跟你浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am completely and utterly through screwing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.99,0:29:03.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战争已经打响  我们的将军还没到\N{\fnArial\fs30}The war has begun. We don't have our general.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.53,0:29:04.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.83,0:29:07.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在  米迦勒会进入他的容器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now,Michael is going to take his vessel
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.33,0:29:10.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,指挥消灭魔鬼的终结之战\N{\fnArial\fs30}And lead the final charge against the adversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.27,0:29:11.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听懂了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.67,0:29:14.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混战会杀死多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many humans die in the crossfire,huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.27,0:29:16.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一百万  五百万  一千万\N{\fnArial\fs30}A million? 5,10?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.11,0:29:17.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许会更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably more.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.54,0:29:19.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道如果不阻止路西法  会死多少人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Lucifer goes unchecked,you know how many die?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.58,0:29:21.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人  他会把人间变成地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them. He'll roast the planet alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.98,0:29:26.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不直接抓我  却跟我讲这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a reason you're telling me this
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.62,0:29:29.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead of just nabbing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.19,0:29:30.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要我的许可\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need my consent.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.69,0:29:34.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米迦勒需要我同意才能用我的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael needs my say-so to ride around in my skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.66,0:29:37.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很不幸  是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately,yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.36,0:29:39.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定有还别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,there's got to be another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.63,0:29:41.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有别的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.40,0:29:43.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仗一定要打\N{\fnArial\fs30}There must be a battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.27,0:29:44.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米迦勒必须战胜魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael must defeat the serpent.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.03,0:29:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,经里写着的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is written.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.17,0:29:48.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.10,0:29:50.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过  话说回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But,on the other hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.24,0:29:51.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.64,0:29:53.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}The answer's no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.84,0:29:54.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.94,0:29:56.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.48,0:29:58.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的朋友鲍比  他伤得很重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friend Bobby ... we know he's gravely injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.58,0:30:00.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你同意  我们就让他康复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh,say yes,and we'll heal him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.65,0:30:02.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不同意  他就再也起不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say no,he'll never walk again.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.79,0:30:08.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.12,0:30:10.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们治好你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how about we heal you from...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.69,0:30:13.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚期胃癌呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stage-4 stomach cancer?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.87,0:30:24.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.01,0:30:26.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就来点儿新鲜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let's get really creative.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.64,0:30:29.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们看看  萨姆没了肺会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh,let's see how... Sam does without his lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.88,0:30:36.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉得好玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we having fun yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.96,0:30:42.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会同意的  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to say yes,Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.49,0:30:44.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了我们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.53,0:30:46.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.16,0:30:49.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh,no.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.30,0:30:51.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才刚刚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.71,0:31:31.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么会\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.44,0:31:32.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.44,0:31:34.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.94,0:31:37.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们两个怎么会上了飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did these two end up on that airplane?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.45,0:31:39.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是个好问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.28,0:31:41.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为不是天使做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause the angels didn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.92,0:31:43.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们都知道答案  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we both know the answer,don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.95,0:31:45.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.05,0:31:47.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.79,0:31:48.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It scares you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.06,0:31:51.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,it should.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.56,0:31:54.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在把他们俩治好  然后滚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now,put these boys back together and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.66,0:31:56.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不说第二次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't ask twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.44,0:32:11.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩个要更加小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two need to be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.31,0:32:12.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  我发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,I'm starting to get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.98,0:32:15.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的兄弟比我预计得要混账\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your frat brothers are bigger dicks than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.45,0:32:17.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说的不是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mean the angels.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.52,0:32:20.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路西法正在接近他的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer is circling his vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.26,0:32:21.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一旦他得手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And once he takes it,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.62,0:32:23.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,巫毒袋就帮不了你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those hex bags won't be enough to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.23,0:32:29.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.70,0:32:32.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以诺派印记\N{\fnArial\fs30}An Enochian Sigil.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.13,0:32:34.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它能让任何天使都无法发现你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll hide you from every angel in creation,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.04,0:32:36.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,包括路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Including Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.44,0:32:37.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你把那东西印在我们身上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What,you just brand us with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.94,0:32:39.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我刻在你们肋骨上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I carved it into your ribs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.88,0:32:45.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西  你真的死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey,Cass,were you really dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.15,0:32:46.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.12,0:32:50.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你怎么回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how are you back?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.97,0:33:11.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.98,0:33:14.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.45,0:33:19.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是梦  尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're dreaming,Nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.38,0:33:23.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但并不是说这不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it doesn't mean this isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.02,0:33:24.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sarah?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.16,0:33:32.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是你妻子  尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not your wife,Nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.86,0:33:34.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.17,0:33:38.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}An angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.57,0:33:41.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.07,0:33:46.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.71,0:33:47.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是自然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.11,0:33:52.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能帮我个忙吗  撒旦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you do me a favor there,Satan,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.38,0:33:55.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,提醒我以后睡前别喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And remind me to quit drinking before I go to bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.32,0:33:57.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来是因为你很特别  尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here because you're special,Nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.92,0:34:02.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像你这样的人非常非常少\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's very,very few people like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.99,0:34:04.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.76,0:34:07.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是一个皮囊  一个完美而强大的皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a vessel -- a very powerful vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.93,0:34:11.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确切地说  那意味着什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning what,exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.50,0:34:16.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要借用并支配你的身体和意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to take control of your mind and your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.01,0:34:21.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老实说\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be honest...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.51,0:34:23.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对你而言可能非常难受\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll probably be unpleasant for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.68,0:34:25.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但却不得不这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it is necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.45,0:34:27.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了  听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay,look...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.55,0:34:30.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了你我好  我想还是立马醒来得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's just the same to you,I think I'd like to wake up now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.35,0:34:32.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过了  这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you -- this is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.36,0:34:36.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.56,0:34:38.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都取决于你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.13,0:34:42.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得由你来邀请我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to invite me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.49,0:34:43.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if this is real --
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.95,0:34:47.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算是假的  也先假设是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which it's not,but assuming it was --
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.60,0:34:50.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又凭什么要答应做这种事儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell would I do something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.64,0:34:53.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们人类完全误会我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You people misunderstand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.52,0:34:59.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们称我为撒旦为魔鬼  但\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call me "Satan" and "Devil," but...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.35,0:35:01.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你们真得了解我的罪孽吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know my crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.75,0:35:05.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经那么深爱着上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved God too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.99,0:35:08.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管如此  他还是遗弃了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for that,he betrayed me --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.16,0:35:11.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并惩罚我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Punished me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.33,0:35:13.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像他惩罚你那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as he's punished you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.20,0:35:18.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则  上帝怎么能眼睁睁地\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all,how could god stand idly by
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.30,0:35:20.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙闯入你家还将你的妻小\N{\fnArial\fs30}While that man broke into your home
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.60,0:35:23.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,血溅于床而袖手旁观呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And butchered your family in their beds?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.26,0:35:26.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有两种解释  尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are only two rational answers,Nick
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.44,0:35:30.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要么是他本就残暴嗜血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either he's sadistic...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.18,0:35:33.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要么就是他压根就漠不关心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or he simply doesn't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.03,0:35:37.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.62,0:35:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你绝对有理由愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have every right to be angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.87,0:35:41.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也很愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am angry,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.56,0:35:44.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我才想要把他找出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I want to find him
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.76,0:35:46.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他对这一切交代清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold him accountable for his actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.26,0:35:48.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能因为他创造了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because he created us
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.54,0:35:51.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就该让他随意愚弄  任他鱼肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't mean he can toy with us,like playthings.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.63,0:35:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我帮了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I help you...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.37,0:35:58.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能让我的家人回到我身边吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you bring back my family?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.44,0:36:00.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.53,0:36:02.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.91,0:36:08.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我能给你其他更好的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I can give you the next best thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.22,0:36:14.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝如此待你  尼克\N{\fnArial\fs30}God did this to you,Nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.39,0:36:19.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我能还你公道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can give you justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.76,0:36:21.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还你安宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.86,0:36:25.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么知道你现在所说的是真的呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I know you're telling the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.75,0:36:28.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为  和你们所知的恰恰相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because,contrary to popular belief,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.96,0:36:30.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.24,0:36:33.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更不需要说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.99,0:36:38.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I need...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.85,0:36:40.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.25,0:36:46.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尼克  我需要你说声同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nick,I need you to say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.83,0:37:01.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.16,0:37:21.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么叫可能再无法行走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Unlikely to walk again"?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.39,0:37:23.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么啊  你这嘴上无毛的二愣子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why,you snot-nosed son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.86,0:37:26.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等我下了这床\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait till I get out of this bed!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.40,0:37:29.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我不用这条瘸腿踢爆你的屁屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll use my game leg and kick your friggin' ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.90,0:37:31.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊  最好能跑快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah,you better run!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.64,0:37:34.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们信那蠢货的话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe that yahoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.08,0:37:35.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由他去吧  你绝对会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw him. you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.02,0:37:39.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过  让我问个超级重要的问题先\N{\fnArial\fs30}So,let me ask the million-dollar question.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.52,0:37:42.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.12,0:37:49.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想  就只能尽最大努力能救多少是多少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We save as many as we can for as long as we can,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.67,0:37:51.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然那根本就是垂死挣扎\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.22,0:37:53.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,管他是天堂还是地狱赢了  我们都是垫背的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever wins,heaven or hell,we're boned.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.56,0:37:54.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那如果是我们赢了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if we win?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.20,0:37:56.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.93,0:37:58.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,管他天使还是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,screw the angels and the demons
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.70,0:38:00.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有他们那个狗屁天启都滚一边儿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And their crap apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.40,0:38:03.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们想火拼开战  找别地儿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want to fight a war,they can find their own planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.00,0:38:07.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这儿可是我们的地盘  绝不让他们在这儿随便撒野\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's ours,and I say they get the hell off it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.41,0:38:08.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就跟他们来硬的  遇魔杀魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take 'em all on. we kill the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.04,0:38:10.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如有必要杀了米迦勒也在所不惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell,we even kill Michael if we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.74,0:38:13.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这一切都得由我们自己做主\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we do it our own damn selves.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.45,0:38:16.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们要怎么办到这一切呢  我的天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how are we supposed to do all this,genius?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.51,0:38:17.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还没头绪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.80,0:38:21.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但就我个人而言  我已经万事俱备了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what I do have is a g.e.d.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.32,0:38:23.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只需要来一阵东风  我就能直捣皇穴了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a "give 'em hell" attitude,and I'll figure it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.95,0:38:29.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小子  你果真是个冲动的单细胞生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are nine kinds of crazy,boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.86,0:38:33.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早听你们说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been said.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.48,0:38:35.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  你呆这儿好好养伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen,you stay on the mend.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.87,0:38:37.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们迟些再来看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see you in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.47,0:38:40.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.24,0:38:44.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时是清醒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.21,0:38:48.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很清楚自己说过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I said back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.82,0:38:52.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want you to know that...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.48,0:38:55.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些话并非我本意\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the demon talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.83,0:39:02.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我决不会弃你于不顾  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't cutting you out,boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.12,0:39:03.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远都不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.97,0:39:10.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks,Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.01,0:39:12.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.54,0:39:14.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这次负伤应得勋章奖励的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I deserve a damn medal for this,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.94,0:39:17.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过  别客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...you're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.85,0:39:29.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在想  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know,I was thinking,Dean
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.23,0:39:31.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们可以再重造柯尔特枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we could go after The Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.68,0:39:32.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  重造它有什么特别吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? what difference would that make?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.86,0:39:34.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以用它来对付路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well,we could use it on Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.70,0:39:35.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚不也说了要回来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,you just said back there --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.63,0:39:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚那堆废话只是宽慰鲍比而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just said a bunch of crap for Bobby's benefit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.50,0:39:42.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  我会奋战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean... I'll fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.73,0:39:45.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定会奋战到最后一刻  但坦白而言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll fight till the last man,but let's at least be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.61,0:39:47.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们压根就没有任何机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,we don't stand a snowball's chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.30,0:39:49.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你心知肚明\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.14,0:39:51.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的  你们大家都心知肚明得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,hell,you of all people know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.78,0:39:52.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.05,0:39:59.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是有话想对我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there something you want to say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.42,0:40:10.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我努力试过了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried,Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.68,0:40:12.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真得努力尝试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean,I really tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.73,0:40:16.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我真得无法再继续假装一切如初\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I just can't keep pretending that everything's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.54,0:40:21.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为已经无法如初了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.07,0:40:22.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经再也回不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's never going to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.74,0:40:25.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你竟然选择了恶魔而不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You chose a demon over your own brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.95,0:40:27.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来瞧瞧着发生的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And look what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.28,0:40:30.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我愿意用任何  任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would give anything -- anything --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.42,0:40:31.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来弥补发生的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}To take it all back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.67,0:40:32.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.95,0:40:37.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更知道你有多后悔多愧疚  我很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know how sorry you are. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.00,0:40:39.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但  我的老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}But,man...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.63,0:40:45.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你曾是我唯一的最信任的依靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were the one that I depended on the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.57,0:40:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然而你让我心寒的方式是我从没有..\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you let me down in ways that I can't even...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.45,0:40:54.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just --
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.19,0:40:57.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要我现在就忘记并原谅你实在有点儿难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm having a hard time forgiving and forgetting here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.21,0:40:59.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.67,0:41:03.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要怎么去弥补呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.65,0:41:06.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想听真话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.56,0:41:09.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没法弥补\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.48,0:41:15.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.40,0:41:18.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我们已经无法回到以前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think that we can ever be what we were.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.36,0:41:19.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.30,0:41:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经无法再信任你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't think I can trust you.
